                  '• Tepe HRR: binek <60kWh›3MW, ?60kWh›6MW · hafif ticari›8MW · aðýr›15MW  (SP 2021:11)\n'
                  '• t² büyüme modeli: ?=0,1876 kW/s² (ultra-fast · ISO 16734 / NFPA 72 Tablo B.2.3)\n'
